## Key Takeaways

- Correlating `4625` → `4624` turns noisy failed-logon alerts into a high-confidence compromise signal.
- Entity mapping only works if the mapped field names exactly match your query output.
- Playbooks need explicit Sentinel permissions before an automation rule can run them.

